TI  - Implantation: Clinical evidence for a detrimental effect on uterine receptivity of high serum oestradiol concentrations in high and normal responder patients
AU  - Cynthia Simon
AU  - Fidel Cano
AU  - Diana Valbuena
AU  - J. Remohi
AU  - Adelina Pellicer
JO  - Human Reproduction
PY  - 1995
VL  - 10
